Fri Nov 13 14:35:04 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of Siag Office 3.6.1, built with the Motif-like
  XawM widget set (upstream default is the NeXTSTEP-like neXtaw)
  and t1lib text rendering through Mowitz
- Add siag-gcc15.patch: missing includes and sockaddr cast, strptime
  feature macro, ncurses stdscr not assignable, tsiag screen margin
  renamed (it clashed with libsiag's paper left_margin under
  -fno-common)
- Add siag-egon-drop-types.patch: egon crashed at startup writing
  through an unallocated drop_types array
- Add siag-xfiler-argv-overflow.patch: argv[4] written past the end
- Add siag-install-duplicate-xpm.patch: duplicate xedplus.xpm broke
  make install
- Add siag-siaghelp-xdg-open.patch: prefer xdg-open for online help
- Add .desktop files and icons
